OL,3,ABurnham prepares to face Badenoch at
OL,4,Afirst PMQs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham is preparing to face
OL,7,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch at
OL,8,Fhis first Prime Minister's Questions
OL,9,Fsince taking office six weeks ago
OL,11,FToday's PMQs comes as the cost of
OL,12,Fborrowing money for the UK nudges
OL,13,Fhigher, reaching a new 18-year high on
OL,14,FWednesday
OL,16,FIt has risen sharply for the UK, and
OL,17,Fgovernments around the world, in recent
OL,18,Fweeks - and is up again slightly this
OL,19,Fmorning
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
